(4738832, 684313, 68035, '<td valign="top">One of those pictures that some people will love but many more will hate (I should now I tried the same with a shot entitled blue daffodil in a challenge a few weeks back) <br/> <br/>Dont look at the score, look at the comments and then reflect on the fact that you have produced an image that has really made some people stop in their tracks and go wow<br/> <br/>Photography (imo) is about touching people and this image will do that for some and you cant (again imo) ask for much more than that</td>', 'One of those pictures that some people will love but many more will hate (I should now I tried the same with a shot entitled blue daffodil in a challenge a few weeks back)  Dont look at the score, look at the comments and then reflect on the fact that you have produced an image that has really made some people stop in their tracks and go wow Photography (imo) is about touching people and this image will do that for some and you cant (again imo) ask for much more than that', '2008-06-01 14:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4738835, 684345, 68035, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people will actually notice the cigarette?  Sadly because of the speed voters not as many that should, not too sure about the processing (for my personal taste) but a great image that made me smile, thank you</td>', 'I wonder how many people will actually notice the cigarette?  Sadly because of the speed voters not as many that should, not too sure about the processing (for my personal taste) but a great image that made me smile, thank you', '2008-06-01 14:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
