(4746508, 682488, 33769, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting symmetrical composition, everything in focus nicely; and the illumination seeming to come from within the flowers is lovely -making it more artistic (which is to my tastes) - part of me wishes that stem wasn''t there- but as i stare at it I enjoy the little splash of green that draws my eyes back down again... and it looks like one beautiful long flower tho I suspect its 3 flowers (i''m no expert on flowers) ;)  --  the softness captured in texture is very nice; and its perfectly in focus giving it an a quality that is somewhat 3d -- personally I might have trimmed a little of the black from the bottom but I tend to crop too much I''m told -</td>', 'This is an interesting symmetrical composition, everything in focus nicely; and the illumination seeming to come from within the flowers is lovely -making it more artistic (which is to my tastes) - part of me wishes that stem wasn''t there- but as i stare at it I enjoy the little splash of green that draws my eyes back down again... and it looks like one beautiful long flower tho I suspect its 3 flowers (i''m no expert on flowers) ;)  --  the softness captured in texture is very nice; and its perfectly in focus giving it an a quality that is somewhat 3d -- personally I might have trimmed a little of the black from the bottom but I tend to crop too much I''m told -', '2008-06-04 00:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
