(4749528, 682491, 67258, '<td valign="top">I shall have to view this again on my monitor at home, as here at work the background appears completely black except for a very small area at the bottom of the frame which may be light reflecting on water.  My initial reaction is thta ithis is well composed, crisp and displays a good level of detail.  However, for my tastes it appears somewhat over-sharpened which does detract from my overall appreciation.<br/> <br/>Edit - A substantially different photo when viewed on my bright screen laptop, and one that comes together far better.  Vote amended.</td>', 'I shall have to view this again on my monitor at home, as here at work the background appears completely black except for a very small area at the bottom of the frame which may be light reflecting on water.  My initial reaction is thta ithis is well composed, crisp and displays a good level of detail.  However, for my tastes it appears somewhat over-sharpened which does detract from my overall appreciation. Edit - A substantially different photo when viewed on my bright screen laptop, and one that comes together far better.  Vote amended.', '2008-06-04 18:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
