(4749604, 683985, 77838, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  At first I though it was water pouring out of a glass but it''s "air" instead; and what looks like air is actually water!  The B&amp;W really adds to this picture. I like that your depth of field is deap enough to include the whole glass and the bubbles. -BB</td>', 'Awesome!  At first I though it was water pouring out of a glass but it''s "air" instead; and what looks like air is actually water!  The B&W really adds to this picture. I like that your depth of field is deap enough to include the whole glass and the bubbles. -BB', '2008-06-04 19:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
