(4750047, 684139, 50695, '<td valign="top">ah, great minimalism. I almost didn''t get past the thumbnail but I''m glad I did.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'ah, great minimalism. I almost didn''t get past the thumbnail but I''m glad I did. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon ', '2008-06-04 21:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750075, 684335, 48546, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent of Susi Lawson <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24111" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">susi</a></td>', 'Reminiscent of Susi Lawson  susi', '2008-06-04 22:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750182, 684017, 74911, '<td valign="top">I like the soft effect of the picture. B&amp;W is working well here. A little over-sharpened IMHO. Otherwise, great expressions, and a cute model too.</td>', 'I like the soft effect of the picture. B&W is working well here. A little over-sharpened IMHO. Otherwise, great expressions, and a cute model too.', '2008-06-04 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750186, 684193, 74911, '<td valign="top">Excellent soft focus effect. It works well with the pose of the puppy.</td>', 'Excellent soft focus effect. It works well with the pose of the puppy.', '2008-06-04 22:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750188, 680101, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice macro attempt. Still, the details on the stamen could have been more prominent.</td>', 'Nice macro attempt. Still, the details on the stamen could have been more prominent.', '2008-06-04 22:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750194, 681760, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wonderful soft focus here. You have managed to get a pleasing picture out of contrasty light. The drops on the gosling adds interest.</td>', 'Wonderful soft focus here. You have managed to get a pleasing picture out of contrasty light. The drops on the gosling adds interest.', '2008-06-04 22:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750198, 682998, 74911, '<td valign="top">Actually you got it :) Wonderful timing. Excellent bokeh BG. The flowers adds interest.</td>', 'Actually you got it :) Wonderful timing. Excellent bokeh BG. The flowers adds interest.', '2008-06-04 22:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750201, 684337, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wonderful silhouette! Great bokeh in the BG. Excellent subject. Overall a sharp and crisp silhouette.</td>', 'Wonderful silhouette! Great bokeh in the BG. Excellent subject. Overall a sharp and crisp silhouette.', '2008-06-04 23:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750206, 684340, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great subject to shoot. Lacks sharpness.</td>', 'Great subject to shoot. Lacks sharpness.', '2008-06-04 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750209, 684311, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted subject(s). Could have been sharper than this to make it a great image.</td>', 'Nicely spotted subject(s). Could have been sharper than this to make it a great image.', '2008-06-04 23:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750215, 683451, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Nice colors, great sharpness on the eyes, pleasing pose. Overall a wonderful image.</td>', 'Great portrait. Nice colors, great sharpness on the eyes, pleasing pose. Overall a wonderful image.', '2008-06-04 23:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750217, 683851, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Good usage of prop.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Good usage of prop.', '2008-06-04 23:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750224, 681948, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice use of backlighting. If there were no blown-out hightlights in the BG&lt; it would have been a very pleasing bokeh. The overall warm and golden tone is very nice.</td>', 'Nice use of backlighting. If there were no blown-out hightlights in the BG< it would have been a very pleasing bokeh. The overall warm and golden tone is very nice.', '2008-06-04 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750226, 684097, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice compo, good sharpness, complimenting BG.</td>', 'Nice compo, good sharpness, complimenting BG.', '2008-06-04 23:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750233, 683257, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great compo. I like how the red bug stands out of the subtle color BG.</td>', 'Great compo. I like how the red bug stands out of the subtle color BG.', '2008-06-04 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750234, 683715, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice pose, and a very good choice of location. A little over-processed in my opinion.</td>', 'Wow! Nice pose, and a very good choice of location. A little over-processed in my opinion.', '2008-06-04 23:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750239, 678666, 74911, '<td valign="top">Not sure, if it was your intention to use the harsh light. Because, the blown out highlights reminds me of noon, rather than early morning. Dodging on the model''s left eye looks unnatural and stands mis-matching with the rest of the face.</td>', 'Not sure, if it was your intention to use the harsh light. Because, the blown out highlights reminds me of noon, rather than early morning. Dodging on the model''s left eye looks unnatural and stands mis-matching with the rest of the face.', '2008-06-04 23:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750241, 681322, 74911, '<td valign="top">Wow, wonderful timing and an excellent capture.</td>', 'Wow, wonderful timing and an excellent capture.', '2008-06-04 23:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750267, 682812, 30850, '<td valign="top">A bit noisy and grainy but a nice capture</td>', 'A bit noisy and grainy but a nice capture', '2008-06-04 23:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750362, 684339, 30850, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors and patterns</td>', 'Awesome colors and patterns', '2008-06-04 23:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750377, 681420, 30850, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  The difference in lighting between the front and sides could have been reduced a bit</td>', 'I like the composition.  The difference in lighting between the front and sides could have been reduced a bit', '2008-06-04 23:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750445, 684044, 41357, '<td valign="top">simple, yet much more meaningful then a lot of the perfect stock photography on this site.</td>', 'simple, yet much more meaningful then a lot of the perfect stock photography on this site.', '2008-06-05 00:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750477, 683229, 84150, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait! This probably would have won the Female Portrait challenge.</td>', 'Excellent portrait! This probably would have won the Female Portrait challenge.', '2008-06-05 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750478, 681136, 84150, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great portrait - 9</td>', 'Nice! Great portrait - 9', '2008-06-05 00:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750491, 679692, 84150, '<td valign="top">I think this image needs to be de-noised.</td>', 'I think this image needs to be de-noised.', '2008-06-05 00:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750495, 677462, 84150, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2008-06-05 00:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750613, 682536, 35804, '<td valign="top">I adore the composition...excellent image of such a beautiful animal.</td>', 'I adore the composition...excellent image of such a beautiful animal.', '2008-06-05 01:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750669, 682305, 41794, '<td valign="top">Ha ha- cobra pose on a pissed off cornsnake. I am very familiar with this position - nice job catching it in a photo!</td>', 'Ha ha- cobra pose on a pissed off cornsnake. I am very familiar with this position - nice job catching it in a photo!', '2008-06-05 01:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750717, 682812, 69368, '<td valign="top">nice captured, but too bad, he is out of focus</td>', 'nice captured, but too bad, he is out of focus', '2008-06-05 02:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750752, 682374, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a nice feel to it - a representation also indicated in your title of simply holding on, yet the bokeh suggests it''s a peaceful activity.  Nice.</td>', 'Has a nice feel to it - a representation also indicated in your title of simply holding on, yet the bokeh suggests it''s a peaceful activity.  Nice.', '2008-06-05 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750753, 680452, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very delicate and peaceful.</td>', 'Very delicate and peaceful.', '2008-06-05 03:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750755, 680723, 30982, '<td valign="top">This should be an honorary entry in the Cowboy challenge.  Wonderful light, excellent location.</td>', 'This should be an honorary entry in the Cowboy challenge.  Wonderful light, excellent location.', '2008-06-05 03:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750759, 684044, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Coming or going?  Can''t tell - could be either, and that''s good.  Great range in tones and excellent job keeping the differences both foreground and beyond the tunnel.  I like that the light post is nearly centered in the composition - a small point of grounding.</td>', 'I really like this.  Coming or going?  Can''t tell - could be either, and that''s good.  Great range in tones and excellent job keeping the differences both foreground and beyond the tunnel.  I like that the light post is nearly centered in the composition - a small point of grounding.', '2008-06-05 03:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750763, 684327, 30982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture and presentation of color, texture, lines and shapes.  This would look great printed large and hung on a wall.</td>', 'A beautiful capture and presentation of color, texture, lines and shapes.  This would look great printed large and hung on a wall.', '2008-06-05 03:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750765, 684103, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful depth of light and tone.  Very timeless, classic.</td>', 'Wonderful depth of light and tone.  Very timeless, classic.', '2008-06-05 03:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750769, 684113, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a nice quiet yet thoughtful kinda piece.  The straggled remnants of past attempts at life, the one that is determined to succeed.</td>', 'This is a nice quiet yet thoughtful kinda piece.  The straggled remnants of past attempts at life, the one that is determined to succeed.', '2008-06-05 03:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750771, 683298, 30982, '<td valign="top">Phenominally strong composition.  A tad more light on the foreground animal''s face would add strength (dodging? selective levels?) but I really do like this.</td>', 'Phenominally strong composition.  A tad more light on the foreground animal''s face would add strength (dodging? selective levels?) but I really do like this.', '2008-06-05 03:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750772, 683962, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the detail on the sticky finger thingies!</td>', 'I love the detail on the sticky finger thingies!', '2008-06-05 03:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750775, 682006, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice strong diagonal composition, good balance to the shot.  A wee bit of fringing along the bridge, both above and below, but doesn''t detract significantly.  I''m not sure how you get rid of that other than very careful cloning.</td>', 'Nice strong diagonal composition, good balance to the shot.  A wee bit of fringing along the bridge, both above and below, but doesn''t detract significantly.  I''m not sure how you get rid of that other than very careful cloning.', '2008-06-05 03:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750780, 683981, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and a wonderful example of how to use bokeh to highlight your subject well.  Great compositionally, too.</td>', 'Excellent detail and a wonderful example of how to use bokeh to highlight your subject well.  Great compositionally, too.', '2008-06-05 03:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750785, 683565, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice depiction of scale, grandeur.  That one itty person really adds to this.</td>', 'Nice depiction of scale, grandeur.  That one itty person really adds to this.', '2008-06-05 03:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750791, 684064, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Your processing really emphasizes the rich pastels of the shot, and this is a very good composition for what is potentially a very "busy" shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Your processing really emphasizes the rich pastels of the shot, and this is a very good composition for what is potentially a very "busy" shot.  Well done.', '2008-06-05 03:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750795, 681077, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous handling of this!  I really like the way you chose to create almost an abstract with your composition, light, processing.</td>', 'Gorgeous handling of this!  I really like the way you chose to create almost an abstract with your composition, light, processing.', '2008-06-05 03:29:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4750798, 683118, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very fun pose and a cool dress!  My only nit is that I dislike the solid background for the fact it almost looks as though she was cut and pasted into it.  Love the light behind her hair!</td>', 'A very fun pose and a cool dress!  My only nit is that I dislike the solid background for the fact it almost looks as though she was cut and pasted into it.  Love the light behind her hair!', '2008-06-05 03:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750801, 683985, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fascinating and well done!  (I''ve been here long enough now that I try to figure these things out - shot glass dropped in water, shot rotated 180 degrees?)  Excellent lighting, tones, detail.  I do hope you''ll post the technical details and perhaps a bit about how you lit this - I''m interested in how you got such great depth of field with such a quick shutter to get the detail in the bubbles so nicely.</td>', 'Fascinating and well done!  (I''ve been here long enough now that I try to figure these things out - shot glass dropped in water, shot rotated 180 degrees?)  Excellent lighting, tones, detail.  I do hope you''ll post the technical details and perhaps a bit about how you lit this - I''m interested in how you got such great depth of field with such a quick shutter to get the detail in the bubbles so nicely.', '2008-06-05 03:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750821, 684293, 37673, '<td valign="top">Why wouldn''t it be a ten!!!!</td>', 'Why wouldn''t it be a ten!!!!', '2008-06-05 03:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750822, 681249, 30982, '<td valign="top">His shoes seem so incongruous, don''t they?  Great shot.</td>', 'His shoes seem so incongruous, don''t they?  Great shot.', '2008-06-05 03:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750825, 677461, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is somehow painfully sad and beautiful at the same time.</td>', 'This is somehow painfully sad and beautiful at the same time.', '2008-06-05 03:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750826, 677725, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a very fun and enjoyable portrait!  Full of energy.</td>', 'What a very fun and enjoyable portrait!  Full of energy.', '2008-06-05 03:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750847, 684179, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous flower - not sure I''ve seen those before.  I love how they come so nicely outlined!</td>', 'What a gorgeous flower - not sure I''ve seen those before.  I love how they come so nicely outlined!', '2008-06-05 04:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750848, 680364, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh - what a great pose!</td>', 'Made me laugh - what a great pose!', '2008-06-05 04:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750851, 681513, 30982, '<td valign="top">rinac?  A beautfully composed shot - excellent editing to bring out the shape and curve of the vessel.</td>', 'rinac?  A beautfully composed shot - excellent editing to bring out the shape and curve of the vessel.', '2008-06-05 04:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750852, 683934, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous and engaging portrait.</td>', 'Gorgeous and engaging portrait.', '2008-06-05 04:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750853, 684345, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Quite fun!</td>', 'LOL!  Quite fun!', '2008-06-05 04:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750854, 681794, 30982, '<td valign="top">What great positioning.</td>', 'What great positioning.', '2008-06-05 04:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4750856, 684209, 30982, '<td valign="top">You know, I''m not sure whether to be sad about all the graffiti on these gorgeous beasts.  I like graffiti in the right place - just not sure it''s here.  And this has nothing to do with the quality of your shot - which is just fine - but the feeling that it invokes.  Really a lovely composition.</td>', 'You know, I''m not sure whether to be sad about all the graffiti on these gorgeous beasts.  I like graffiti in the right place - just not sure it''s here.  And this has nothing to do with the quality of your shot - which is just fine - but the feeling that it invokes.  Really a lovely composition.', '2008-06-05 04:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
