(4753244, 684227, 30982, '<td valign="top">Classic and very well executed.</td>', 'Classic and very well executed.', '2008-06-06 03:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753249, 683990, 30982, '<td valign="top">The layering of color in the water/background really supports this very well.</td>', 'The layering of color in the water/background really supports this very well.', '2008-06-06 03:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753255, 680234, 30982, '<td valign="top">WAY fun!  Delightful shot.</td>', 'WAY fun!  Delightful shot.', '2008-06-06 03:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753261, 684281, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has the most marvelous emotion in it!  Wonderful.  I''m going to think it was a caught moment rather than a staged shot, simply because it''s that "real" - whether it was or wasn''t, you''ve conveyed it as such.  Great shot - works on all counts.</td>', 'This has the most marvelous emotion in it!  Wonderful.  I''m going to think it was a caught moment rather than a staged shot, simply because it''s that "real" - whether it was or wasn''t, you''ve conveyed it as such.  Great shot - works on all counts.', '2008-06-06 03:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753315, 680234, 31535, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. Women are always happy when they''re shopping :)</td>', 'Fun shot. Women are always happy when they''re shopping :)', '2008-06-06 03:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753336, 684245, 31535, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. I love the fact her eyes match the reds in rest of the photo. It''s suttle but it really draws you in.</td>', 'Beautiful photo. I love the fact her eyes match the reds in rest of the photo. It''s suttle but it really draws you in.', '2008-06-06 04:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753343, 684330, 31535, '<td valign="top">Adorable. I love shots like these. With the large male hand in there, you really get a sense of how small and fragile babies are.</td>', 'Adorable. I love shots like these. With the large male hand in there, you really get a sense of how small and fragile babies are.', '2008-06-06 04:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753377, 681513, 60195, '<td valign="top">I absolutely <b>love</b> this.  Everything about it... the lighting, the comp, the processing, AND the border (it just wouldn''t have the same overall feel without it).  I feel like I''m watching a really cool DVD with some awesome cinematography.  What a great perspective! Well done - see you on the front page at roll-over :O)</td>', 'I absolutely love this.  Everything about it... the lighting, the comp, the processing, AND the border (it just wouldn''t have the same overall feel without it).  I feel like I''m watching a really cool DVD with some awesome cinematography.  What a great perspective! Well done - see you on the front page at roll-over :O)', '2008-06-06 04:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753381, 678727, 60195, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one.  Great lighting, comp, and processing. Really puts the viewer (me) backstage. There are so many elements to look at in this - and I think the one that stands out the most for me - is the great eye contact from the girl on the far right.  Classic shot, and a fav.  Well done!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one.  Great lighting, comp, and processing. Really puts the viewer (me) backstage. There are so many elements to look at in this - and I think the one that stands out the most for me - is the great eye contact from the girl on the far right.  Classic shot, and a fav.  Well done!', '2008-06-06 04:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753385, 684027, 60195, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture.  Love the feel of this... you''ve realy done a great job of capturing the moment (or second). Incredible clarity... it has a very surreal feel to it - and that''s pretty hard, seeing as it''s a lightbulb ;o)  Extremely well done.</td>', 'Awesome capture.  Love the feel of this... you''ve realy done a great job of capturing the moment (or second). Incredible clarity... it has a very surreal feel to it - and that''s pretty hard, seeing as it''s a lightbulb ;o)  Extremely well done.', '2008-06-06 04:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753390, 683979, 60195, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about this - what a striking image. Great comp, processing, and lighting. This little guy is just classic... the viewer gets the feeling that you''re intruding in his space, and you''re about to get clobbered with that stick. Yet you look again, and it''s almost playful. Ver well done - I hope the viewers take the time to slow down &amp; appreciate this image.</td>', 'There''s just something about this - what a striking image. Great comp, processing, and lighting. This little guy is just classic... the viewer gets the feeling that you''re intruding in his space, and you''re about to get clobbered with that stick. Yet you look again, and it''s almost playful. Ver well done - I hope the viewers take the time to slow down & appreciate this image.', '2008-06-06 04:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753457, 681295, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good isolation of the silhouette against the strong lighting in the background - difficult lighting situation.</td>', '7 - Good isolation of the silhouette against the strong lighting in the background - difficult lighting situation.', '2008-06-06 06:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753459, 684179, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good image, like your composition - miss the textures a little but the ''smoothness'' in the white of the petals enhance the flowers, especially with those beautiful patterns / markings.  Tough crop call.</td>', '8 - Good image, like your composition - miss the textures a little but the ''smoothness'' in the white of the petals enhance the flowers, especially with those beautiful patterns / markings.  Tough crop call.', '2008-06-06 06:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753461, 683724, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice lens.  I always enjoy these images.</td>', '7 - Nice lens.  I always enjoy these images.', '2008-06-06 06:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753462, 681760, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice colors.</td>', '8 - Nice colors.', '2008-06-06 06:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753466, 683927, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Nice scene, wonder about a variation in composition/crop to bring out its assets more.  Either something funky going on in pp in the two rocks or else natural markings, which can''t be appreciated at this size.  Will check back pc to ''see''.</td>', '4 - Nice scene, wonder about a variation in composition/crop to bring out its assets more.  Either something funky going on in pp in the two rocks or else natural markings, which can''t be appreciated at this size.  Will check back pc to ''see''.', '2008-06-06 06:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4753476, 679782, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice texture in the poppies, don''t mind the elongated crop/framing.  Colors are nice, including the blue background.  The vase cropped throws me though..</td>', '6 - Nice texture in the poppies, don''t mind the elongated crop/framing.  Colors are nice, including the blue background.  The vase cropped throws me though..', '2008-06-06 06:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
