(4754010, 684330, 94064, '<td valign="top">So sweet!  The neck at the top is a little distracting.</td>', 'So sweet!  The neck at the top is a little distracting.', '2008-06-06 12:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754015, 683103, 94064, '<td valign="top">Just perfect.</td>', 'Just perfect.', '2008-06-06 12:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754016, 683719, 68546, '<td valign="top">lovely feel to this shot, the muted colours give it an older film like feel to it. Not sure I can pinpoint why i like it but it has a fun and carefree feel to it with an element of softness that makes it very easy on the eye. One of my favourites so far</td>', 'lovely feel to this shot, the muted colours give it an older film like feel to it. Not sure I can pinpoint why i like it but it has a fun and carefree feel to it with an element of softness that makes it very easy on the eye. One of my favourites so far', '2008-06-06 12:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754034, 675758, 68546, '<td valign="top">stunning, really great use of background, the pose and skin tones are excellent. Very nice portrait, if I had one critisism I would prefer a little more space on the right as to not crop her arm.</td>', 'stunning, really great use of background, the pose and skin tones are excellent. Very nice portrait, if I had one critisism I would prefer a little more space on the right as to not crop her arm.', '2008-06-06 12:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754036, 683409, 94064, '<td valign="top">The fence and that old piece of equipment (whatever it is) are interesting enough subjects, you didn''t need the girl.</td>', 'The fence and that old piece of equipment (whatever it is) are interesting enough subjects, you didn''t need the girl.', '2008-06-06 12:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754043, 684294, 68546, '<td valign="top">very quirky! I like the composition and the dark green background, not sure what the message or story is though?  The fact the pigs been gutted makes it a little odd for her to be holding it like a pet? Interesting though, I like the off the wall entries.</td>', 'very quirky! I like the composition and the dark green background, not sure what the message or story is though?  The fact the pigs been gutted makes it a little odd for her to be holding it like a pet? Interesting though, I like the off the wall entries.', '2008-06-06 12:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754044, 684032, 94064, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion.  I would have liked to have seen the fence straightened out.</td>', 'Great sense of motion.  I would have liked to have seen the fence straightened out.', '2008-06-06 12:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754051, 683451, 68546, '<td valign="top">excellent portrait, the composition and DOF work really well on this shot and the use of arm to shade the eye helps to keep the fadce lighting even. I''m sure you''ll get some great votes and comments from the ladies but then it''s a fantastic portrait so it''s well deserved!</td>', 'excellent portrait, the composition and DOF work really well on this shot and the use of arm to shade the eye helps to keep the fadce lighting even. I''m sure you''ll get some great votes and comments from the ladies but then it''s a fantastic portrait so it''s well deserved!', '2008-06-06 12:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754060, 684205, 68546, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting for the shot! I find the lighting a little harsh on the models face and the models legs blend together as one which detracts from the pose slightly. But in all a very nice image</td>', 'Lovely setting for the shot! I find the lighting a little harsh on the models face and the models legs blend together as one which detracts from the pose slightly. But in all a very nice image', '2008-06-06 12:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
