(4754866, 684186, 208, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the crop, but I do like the soft focus.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the crop, but I do like the soft focus.', '2008-06-06 20:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754875, 684129, 208, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you needed the selective desaturation here. My eyes keep going to his red phone. He''s in focus enough and -more importantly- dynamic enough to draw attention without any trickery. Otherwise, this is a cool street scene. Good choice with the angle - makes it look like you snuck the shot with the camera at your hip (and maybe that''s what you did).</td>', 'I don''t think you needed the selective desaturation here. My eyes keep going to his red phone. He''s in focus enough and -more importantly- dynamic enough to draw attention without any trickery. Otherwise, this is a cool street scene. Good choice with the angle - makes it look like you snuck the shot with the camera at your hip (and maybe that''s what you did).', '2008-06-06 20:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754877, 680364, 2158, '<td valign="top">Fantastic timing.</td>', 'Fantastic timing.', '2008-06-06 20:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754882, 682289, 208, '<td valign="top">Well, this is nice and all, but there isn''t much to it. It''s pretty scenery, but nothing to catch my eye. I''m mostly looking at the dark mass in the bright green, but it isn''t enough to carry the load.</td>', 'Well, this is nice and all, but there isn''t much to it. It''s pretty scenery, but nothing to catch my eye. I''m mostly looking at the dark mass in the bright green, but it isn''t enough to carry the load.', '2008-06-06 20:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754890, 678666, 208, '<td valign="top">His left eye looks a little too bright for the lighting, but the greens (matching his eyes) are just great.</td>', 'His left eye looks a little too bright for the lighting, but the greens (matching his eyes) are just great.', '2008-06-06 21:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754895, 683491, 208, '<td valign="top">The technique might not be perfect, but his expression sure is. Good choice to let the subject do the talking and keep everything looking natural, without lots of editing.</td>', 'The technique might not be perfect, but his expression sure is. Good choice to let the subject do the talking and keep everything looking natural, without lots of editing.', '2008-06-06 21:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754898, 684060, 208, '<td valign="top">A little too much color saturation, but a great postcard shot of Prague.</td>', 'A little too much color saturation, but a great postcard shot of Prague.', '2008-06-06 21:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754904, 680234, 208, '<td valign="top">OK, this made me laugh.</td>', 'OK, this made me laugh.', '2008-06-06 21:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754906, 678727, 208, '<td valign="top">This is amazingly cool. The light is perfect. Great expressions on the crowd. The confetti surrounding the MC makes him even more dynamic.<br/>edit: "confetti" duh<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-08 16:57:18.</i></td>', 'This is amazingly cool. The light is perfect. Great expressions on the crowd. The confetti surrounding the MC makes him even more dynamic.edit: "confetti" duh', '2008-06-06 21:27:56.000000', '2008-06-08 17:57:18.000000', 1),
(4754949, 684267, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Super strong composition and crop.  Strong complementary tones.  The shadow play gives it the extra drama too.  The line top right is a little distracting, but fairly minor.  Nice ve hi cle.  Be nice to see the ''flamethrower'' texture/metal bolder, ''somehow''.  Good title.</td>', '7 - Super strong composition and crop.  Strong complementary tones.  The shadow play gives it the extra drama too.  The line top right is a little distracting, but fairly minor.  Nice ve hi cle.  Be nice to see the ''flamethrower'' texture/metal bolder, ''somehow''.  Good title.', '2008-06-06 22:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754961, 682447, 40355, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, you well capturing the place - especially having the bridge in the background.  Very well composed.  I can remember swimming in that same spot when I was a kid :-)</td>', 'Lovely shot, you well capturing the place - especially having the bridge in the background.  Very well composed.  I can remember swimming in that same spot when I was a kid :-)', '2008-06-06 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754962, 684032, 40355, '<td valign="top">I love the focus on the left horse and the sense of movement this photo captures.  I''m really not fond of the way you cut the head off the right horse.  It''s still a heck of a good photo, but it''s too bad you couldn''t get all of that right-side horse, or exclude it.</td>', 'I love the focus on the left horse and the sense of movement this photo captures.  I''m really not fond of the way you cut the head off the right horse.  It''s still a heck of a good photo, but it''s too bad you couldn''t get all of that right-side horse, or exclude it.', '2008-06-06 22:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754964, 682565, 40355, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range, interesting lighting.  The blue of the water looks a little too blue to my eye, but my main complaint is the bridge: A) it bisects the scene too close to dead center, and B) it covers the shoreline in the background, which would be a nice area to see, the shore meeting the water and all.</td>', 'Nice tonal range, interesting lighting.  The blue of the water looks a little too blue to my eye, but my main complaint is the bridge: A) it bisects the scene too close to dead center, and B) it covers the shoreline in the background, which would be a nice area to see, the shore meeting the water and all.', '2008-06-06 22:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754973, 684315, 40355, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of the paint.  However, the burning around the perimeter is a bit excessive.</td>', 'Lovely capture of the paint.  However, the burning around the perimeter is a bit excessive.', '2008-06-06 22:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754976, 682489, 40355, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture of the landing - looks like it''s headed for disaster, but I trust that the runway is really there!  A suggestion: when shooting propeller planes, fast shutter speeds freeze the prop (such as happened here), which leaves it looking odd.  A slower shutter speed and a bit of panning adds a sense of motion to the background and keeps the prop arc, which can be pretty cool.</td>', 'Interesting capture of the landing - looks like it''s headed for disaster, but I trust that the runway is really there!  A suggestion: when shooting propeller planes, fast shutter speeds freeze the prop (such as happened here), which leaves it looking odd.  A slower shutter speed and a bit of panning adds a sense of motion to the background and keeps the prop arc, which can be pretty cool.', '2008-06-06 22:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754987, 676992, 73601, '<td valign="top">wow........</td>', 'wow........', '2008-06-06 22:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
