(4755541, 683229, 20506, '<td valign="top">Excellent light and composition really nice focus on the face, the focus draws your eye to the face which is very nice. A very attractive model too. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent light and composition really nice focus on the face, the focus draws your eye to the face which is very nice. A very attractive model too. Well done.', '2008-06-07 09:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
