(4755546, 682153, 20506, '<td valign="top">Interesting minimal feel, composition draws your eye to the silhouette of the person too.</td>', 'Interesting minimal feel, composition draws your eye to the silhouette of the person too.', '2008-06-07 09:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755550, 678075, 20506, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this shot it was cut off had to scroll to see it all. I thought wow lovely compositioin the light and focus are superb. As I scrolled though I thought the dress and the arm were too major a part of the pic when I first saw it, I saw it as almost a square crop and I prefered it that way. Having said that 9 So I guess for me it was lose the snake! LOL</td>', 'When I first saw this shot it was cut off had to scroll to see it all. I thought wow lovely compositioin the light and focus are superb. As I scrolled though I thought the dress and the arm were too major a part of the pic when I first saw it, I saw it as almost a square crop and I prefered it that way. Having said that 9 So I guess for me it was lose the snake! LOL', '2008-06-07 09:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755551, 684056, 20506, '<td valign="top">Nice it''s unusal to see a full sun composition with the sun so low in the shot. I like it well done.</td>', 'Nice it''s unusal to see a full sun composition with the sun so low in the shot. I like it well done.', '2008-06-07 09:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755552, 681420, 20506, '<td valign="top">Always a beautiful sight a pregnant woman. There is nothing more ultimately feminine. I love the light and the tenderness of the shot. Just got to say from the title, poor hubby LOL!</td>', 'Always a beautiful sight a pregnant woman. There is nothing more ultimately feminine. I love the light and the tenderness of the shot. Just got to say from the title, poor hubby LOL!', '2008-06-07 09:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755554, 677252, 84764, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours. Very nice composition, the brown framing the blue parts.</td>', 'Beautiful colours. Very nice composition, the brown framing the blue parts.', '2008-06-07 09:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755557, 684294, 20506, '<td valign="top">NO NO NO NO NO, I had a pet pig I adored, I couldn''t eat them anymore! Seeing this picture although a powerful emotion evoking image, disturbs me. But I guess that is the objective of the shot and so you certainly achieved that and on that basis and the technical aspects of the shot I will vote not with my heart but with my head 9</td>', 'NO NO NO NO NO, I had a pet pig I adored, I couldn''t eat them anymore! Seeing this picture although a powerful emotion evoking image, disturbs me. But I guess that is the objective of the shot and so you certainly achieved that and on that basis and the technical aspects of the shot I will vote not with my heart but with my head 9', '2008-06-07 09:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755560, 677080, 20506, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the focus is wonderful the hue seems a little off though was that deliberate?</td>', 'I love the composition and the focus is wonderful the hue seems a little off though was that deliberate?', '2008-06-07 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
