(4755621, 681136, 20506, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, wonderful skin the eyes are amazing and the colours are terrific. I would like to see an almost square crop on this though less of the blanket I guess and more focus on the beautiful face and eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful, wonderful skin the eyes are amazing and the colours are terrific. I would like to see an almost square crop on this though less of the blanket I guess and more focus on the beautiful face and eyes.', '2008-06-07 09:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
