(4755678, 682574, 20506, '<td valign="top">Aweeee what an adorable expression, wonderful capture amazing focus adorable shot in many ways well done.</td>', 'Aweeee what an adorable expression, wonderful capture amazing focus adorable shot in many ways well done.', '2008-06-07 10:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
