(4755682, 683853, 20506, '<td valign="top">Love the colours of this shot! the focus and sharpness of the image is very well done too.</td>', 'Love the colours of this shot! the focus and sharpness of the image is very well done too.', '2008-06-07 10:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755687, 679908, 20506, '<td valign="top">What a stunning beauty! I really like the happy content feel to the shot the models connection with the lens really is lovely. Would have liked to have seen the shot just a little shaper in focus though.</td>', 'What a stunning beauty! I really like the happy content feel to the shot the models connection with the lens really is lovely. Would have liked to have seen the shot just a little shaper in focus though.', '2008-06-07 10:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755703, 683848, 55838, '<td valign="top">A cool photojournalist type shot that conveys great expectations for this young man.  Just has a good feel to it overall too.  Nicely done.  8 from me.</td>', 'A cool photojournalist type shot that conveys great expectations for this young man.  Just has a good feel to it overall too.  Nicely done.  8 from me.', '2008-06-07 10:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755706, 684294, 55838, '<td valign="top">Talk about your quirky, unusual, odd sort of shot.  Very interesting, sad, entertaining, all at the same time.  Nice background color &amp; texture.  9 for the strange, cool, creativity.</td>', 'Talk about your quirky, unusual, odd sort of shot.  Very interesting, sad, entertaining, all at the same time.  Nice background color & texture.  9 for the strange, cool, creativity.', '2008-06-07 10:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755723, 676420, 30791, '<td valign="top">great moment in time you captured here, well done</td>', 'great moment in time you captured here, well done', '2008-06-07 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755728, 682723, 30791, '<td valign="top">woah this is gorgeous</td>', 'woah this is gorgeous', '2008-06-07 11:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755742, 678727, 30791, '<td valign="top">there must be something un attrative on the otherside of what is visible to the viewer thats making the ladies make all those faces ;)<br/>but in all seriousness this is a remarkable photo, and how you did the lighting is amazing</td>', 'there must be something un attrative on the otherside of what is visible to the viewer thats making the ladies make all those faces ;)but in all seriousness this is a remarkable photo, and how you did the lighting is amazing', '2008-06-07 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755824, 684219, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice capture - wish the ant was more dominant in the frame.</td>', '7 - Nice capture - wish the ant was more dominant in the frame.', '2008-06-07 12:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755827, 684032, 89720, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2008-06-07 12:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755858, 684137, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally a fan of selective desat, but this one gets a bonus point since I didn''t even realize you''d used the technique at first.  It all felt very natural, and I think with a brightly colored background the horse may have gotten lost.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I''m not normally a fan of selective desat, but this one gets a bonus point since I didn''t even realize you''d used the technique at first.  It all felt very natural, and I think with a brightly colored background the horse may have gotten lost.  Nicely done.', '2008-06-07 12:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755886, 677462, 36006, '<td valign="top">Timmy,<br/> <br/>I liked this image on the other site, and I like it here as well.<br/> <br/>The only critique I would have is the blacks are too deep, but it doesn''t bother me. The tonal value of the skin tones was my first impression.<br/> <br/>Very well crafted basic b/w portrait.</td>', 'Timmy, I liked this image on the other site, and I like it here as well. The only critique I would have is the blacks are too deep, but it doesn''t bother me. The tonal value of the skin tones was my first impression. Very well crafted basic b/w portrait.', '2008-06-07 13:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755888, 680871, 58457, '<td valign="top">Really good use of a filter effect here.  Subtle, and well blended.  Your lighting and composition help out quite a bit.  My only criticism would be to maybe have the pencil a bit sharper.</td>', 'Really good use of a filter effect here.  Subtle, and well blended.  Your lighting and composition help out quite a bit.  My only criticism would be to maybe have the pencil a bit sharper.', '2008-06-07 13:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755898, 678727, 58457, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The thing I can''t get over though is that most of the crowd looks really disinterested, and its kind weird how the girl on the right stares out at the viewer.  I can''t decide if the crowd makes or breaks the shot.  Otherwise though one of my favorite so far.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The thing I can''t get over though is that most of the crowd looks really disinterested, and its kind weird how the girl on the right stares out at the viewer.  I can''t decide if the crowd makes or breaks the shot.  Otherwise though one of my favorite so far.', '2008-06-07 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755902, 680962, 58457, '<td valign="top">cute.  and I normally don''t like cats but this is a great catch</td>', 'cute.  and I normally don''t like cats but this is a great catch', '2008-06-07 13:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755907, 683729, 36006, '<td valign="top">The tonal value seems a bit off.<br/> <br/>The whites are not there yet, and the blacks are a bit deep.<br/> <br/>However, this is a great example of story telling.<br/> <br/>Nicly done.</td>', 'The tonal value seems a bit off. The whites are not there yet, and the blacks are a bit deep. However, this is a great example of story telling. Nicly done.', '2008-06-07 13:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755919, 683058, 36006, '<td valign="top">This is a cute kid, but your tonal values really need help.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-08 13:11:49.</i></td>', 'This is a cute kid, but your tonal values really need help.', '2008-06-07 13:19:08.000000', '2008-06-08 14:11:49.000000', 1),
(4755934, 677725, 20506, '<td valign="top">Really cute! nice light in the eyes.</td>', 'Really cute! nice light in the eyes.', '2008-06-07 13:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755958, 681207, 20506, '<td valign="top">Amazing all of it well done. 10</td>', 'Amazing all of it well done. 10', '2008-06-07 13:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755962, 681273, 20506, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colour and mood the silouettes of the people really add that extra interest to the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful colour and mood the silouettes of the people really add that extra interest to the shot.', '2008-06-07 13:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755989, 680325, 36006, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.<br/> <br/>Too much negative space above the model. Light a bit harsh, color is ok, texture is ok, basically its a good picture, just a couple of improvements.</td>', 'Nice idea. Too much negative space above the model. Light a bit harsh, color is ok, texture is ok, basically its a good picture, just a couple of improvements.', '2008-06-07 13:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755991, 682720, 42100, '<td valign="top">Wow, that has to be the most unsual and amazing looking waterfall I''ve ever in real life or a photo!</td>', 'Wow, that has to be the most unsual and amazing looking waterfall I''ve ever in real life or a photo!', '2008-06-07 13:53:45.000000', NULL, 1);
