(4756247, 683914, 94226, '<td valign="top">I like old trucks so I was drawn to this picture. I think this picture would be greatly improved if there were less height and more width, or at the least more width. The trees above the truck take away from the subject, and having the fenders and bumper cut off make the truck look narrow.</td>', 'I like old trucks so I was drawn to this picture. I think this picture would be greatly improved if there were less height and more width, or at the least more width. The trees above the truck take away from the subject, and having the fenders and bumper cut off make the truck look narrow.', '2008-06-07 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
