(4756348, 683333, 94226, '<td valign="top">Impressive.</td>', 'Impressive.', '2008-06-07 18:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756352, 679028, 94226, '<td valign="top">This photo just jumped out from the rest for me. The contrasts of humans vs. sculpture, mist vs. wall, and the tree branches vs. the top of the wall depict transitory vs. permanent, yet, as the title suggests, both are enduring. Very nice.</td>', 'This photo just jumped out from the rest for me. The contrasts of humans vs. sculpture, mist vs. wall, and the tree branches vs. the top of the wall depict transitory vs. permanent, yet, as the title suggests, both are enduring. Very nice.', '2008-06-07 18:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756371, 683885, 47852, '<td valign="top">What a great mixture of colors and textures, yet it''s so simple.</td>', 'What a great mixture of colors and textures, yet it''s so simple.', '2008-06-07 18:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756379, 677111, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the creamy colors in the background and the sharp, dark silhouette in contrast.  I''m not sure about the halo around the dark area though, I wish the silhouette stood more on it''s own.</td>', 'Love the creamy colors in the background and the sharp, dark silhouette in contrast.  I''m not sure about the halo around the dark area though, I wish the silhouette stood more on it''s own.', '2008-06-07 18:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756397, 682006, 94226, '<td valign="top">OB is OK!</td>', 'OB is OK!', '2008-06-07 18:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756401, 684192, 67258, '<td valign="top">A view I know well - I have alarmed a number of visitors to York (including <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> aka Deb) by lying down on the floor to take the same shot.  You have a good photo here, and one that I would be pleased to have taken.  I do wish, though, that it was a little more symmetrical, with the same amount of arch showing top and bottom - perhaps worth trying a new crop?<br/> <br/>Edit to correct numerous typos.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-08 02:15:04.</i></td>', 'A view I know well - I have alarmed a number of visitors to York (including  Melethia aka Deb) by lying down on the floor to take the same shot.  You have a good photo here, and one that I would be pleased to have taken.  I do wish, though, that it was a little more symmetrical, with the same amount of arch showing top and bottom - perhaps worth trying a new crop? Edit to correct numerous typos.', '2008-06-07 18:36:33.000000', '2008-06-08 03:15:04.000000', 1),
(4756409, 683985, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and presented. The silvery color and contrast, the strong focus, and the composition are very vry effective. Well done.</td>', 'Nicely captured and presented. The silvery color and contrast, the strong focus, and the composition are very vry effective. Well done.', '2008-06-07 18:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756413, 678286, 67258, '<td valign="top">Technically sound but, for this viewer, empty.  6.</td>', 'Technically sound but, for this viewer, empty.  6.', '2008-06-07 18:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756416, 681198, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect this was taken in less than ideal lighting.</td>', 'I suspect this was taken in less than ideal lighting.', '2008-06-07 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756421, 683964, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is a pair of Goldeneye on my local lake - i only discovered yesterday on BBC Springwatch that they are rare in the UK!  This photo is a little soft in focus, but the pose is sufficiently interesting to compensate.</td>', 'There is a pair of Goldeneye on my local lake - i only discovered yesterday on BBC Springwatch that they are rare in the UK!  This photo is a little soft in focus, but the pose is sufficiently interesting to compensate.', '2008-06-07 18:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756422, 678286, 18197, '<td valign="top">I do believe in spooks! No seriously, lovely girl, well captured and presented. Lighting is great.</td>', 'I do believe in spooks! No seriously, lovely girl, well captured and presented. Lighting is great.', '2008-06-07 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756423, 684294, 208, '<td valign="top">What a bizarre portrait. And a cryptic title. Looks like there''s a bad halo around her from editing. Fix that and you''ve got a great photograph.</td>', 'What a bizarre portrait. And a cryptic title. Looks like there''s a bad halo around her from editing. Fix that and you''ve got a great photograph.', '2008-06-07 18:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756425, 684294, 67258, '<td valign="top">This really intrigues me, and is a photo I have viewed a number of times.  Aside from any story or purpose, it is a technically sound image; on an aesthetic perspective, it works very well with its thoroughly balanced composition and excellent colour palette and tonal range.  The narrative has, to a certain extent, gone over my head - I can see the relationship of the clock to the title, but not the other elements.  This is by no means a criticism , I am thoroughly looking forward to reading your explanation.  Without being able to explain why, I admire this photograph tremendously.<br/> <br/>Edit - numerous typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-08 02:04:25.</i></td>', 'This really intrigues me, and is a photo I have viewed a number of times.  Aside from any story or purpose, it is a technically sound image; on an aesthetic perspective, it works very well with its thoroughly balanced composition and excellent colour palette and tonal range.  The narrative has, to a certain extent, gone over my head - I can see the relationship of the clock to the title, but not the other elements.  This is by no means a criticism , I am thoroughly looking forward to reading your explanation.  Without being able to explain why, I admire this photograph tremendously. Edit - numerous typos', '2008-06-07 18:45:30.000000', '2008-06-08 03:04:25.000000', 1),
(4756426, 678212, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh God, that is so seriously cute!  The choice of background is perfect giving a wonderful restricted colour palette.  the only thing that possibly improve this is if the rabbit to the far left had proved a little more co-operative and looked inwards!  Might be worth submitting this to some greeting card companies.</td>', 'Oh God, that is so seriously cute!  The choice of background is perfect giving a wonderful restricted colour palette.  the only thing that possibly improve this is if the rabbit to the far left had proved a little more co-operative and looked inwards!  Might be worth submitting this to some greeting card companies.', '2008-06-07 18:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756429, 680813, 67258, '<td valign="top">I''m not ususlly very keen on hyper-saturation, but here it works.  This is in a league above most sunset shots, and I think that is all in the detail:  the tip of the sun as it disappears over the horizon matching to your title so well, the balance of the trees and their wonderful reflections, and the diagonal clouds (or dispersing contrails?) leading the eye.</td>', 'I''m not ususlly very keen on hyper-saturation, but here it works.  This is in a league above most sunset shots, and I think that is all in the detail:  the tip of the sun as it disappears over the horizon matching to your title so well, the balance of the trees and their wonderful reflections, and the diagonal clouds (or dispersing contrails?) leading the eye.', '2008-06-07 18:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756430, 684315, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF. Don''t particularly care for blue vignette. Otherwise good colors.</td>', 'Interesting DOF. Don''t particularly care for blue vignette. Otherwise good colors.', '2008-06-07 18:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756432, 676992, 67258, '<td valign="top">The pathos presented here is almost unbearable - incredibly beautiful in its poignancy.</td>', 'The pathos presented here is almost unbearable - incredibly beautiful in its poignancy.', '2008-06-07 18:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756436, 681669, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is just so lovely, my idealised image of childhood.</td>', 'This is just so lovely, my idealised image of childhood.', '2008-06-07 18:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756437, 683409, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. I like the color and line correspondance between the dress and the fence. There''s a nice triangle dynamic going on between the girl and the piece of equipment. Beyond that, the post processing goes a bit beyond my preferences.</td>', 'Interesting subject. I like the color and line correspondance between the dress and the fence. There''s a nice triangle dynamic going on between the girl and the piece of equipment. Beyond that, the post processing goes a bit beyond my preferences.', '2008-06-07 18:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756439, 683132, 67258, '<td valign="top">The repeating motifs work extremely well.  A simple, but thoroughly effective image. 7.</td>', 'The repeating motifs work extremely well.  A simple, but thoroughly effective image. 7.', '2008-06-07 18:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756440, 684129, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great candid feel to this ... sort of a shot-from-the-hip feeling. B&amp;W works well.</td>', 'Great candid feel to this ... sort of a shot-from-the-hip feeling. B&W works well.', '2008-06-07 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756442, 680094, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very yellow!! With the red door, it certainly makes a statement ... hot outside, cool in the pool. Makes me want to go in.</td>', 'Wow! Very yellow!! With the red door, it certainly makes a statement ... hot outside, cool in the pool. Makes me want to go in.', '2008-06-07 18:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756444, 682387, 208, '<td valign="top">Love the composition of this.</td>', 'Love the composition of this.', '2008-06-07 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756447, 682410, 18197, '<td valign="top">A technically competant capture and presentation. Good job with that, especially DOF and focus on your subject. Subject doesn''t particularly hold me, however.</td>', 'A technically competant capture and presentation. Good job with that, especially DOF and focus on your subject. Subject doesn''t particularly hold me, however.', '2008-06-07 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756450, 683710, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the detail you''ve captured. I think it would be stronger if the foreground was brightened up just a bit. I lose some of the interesting detail here, because it''s so dark.</td>', 'I like the subject and the detail you''ve captured. I think it would be stronger if the foreground was brightened up just a bit. I lose some of the interesting detail here, because it''s so dark.', '2008-06-07 18:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756452, 682279, 18197, '<td valign="top">Sometimes we take photos that mean a great deal to us because of our affinity with the subject. Perhaps that''s the case here. But I don''t have an affinity with the subject, so it''s not as interesting to me.</td>', 'Sometimes we take photos that mean a great deal to us because of our affinity with the subject. Perhaps that''s the case here. But I don''t have an affinity with the subject, so it''s not as interesting to me.', '2008-06-07 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756456, 681905, 18197, '<td valign="top">This subject and situation offers a lot of potential for great photography! And it offers many challenges in composition. The plane and it''s smoke trail get lost against the bridge lessening the dramatic impact.</td>', 'This subject and situation offers a lot of potential for great photography! And it offers many challenges in composition. The plane and it''s smoke trail get lost against the bridge lessening the dramatic impact.', '2008-06-07 18:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756458, 684310, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well captured and presented. But the subject doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'Well captured and presented. But the subject doesn''t hold my interest.', '2008-06-07 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756461, 679405, 18197, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you intended the tilted composition. If so, I''m sorry for the following comment. The tilt looks accidental and therefore sloppy. I seem to appreciate more either straight compositions, or tilts of a greater degree that are obvioulsy intended to increase the esthetics of the photo.</td>', 'Perhaps you intended the tilted composition. If so, I''m sorry for the following comment. The tilt looks accidental and therefore sloppy. I seem to appreciate more either straight compositions, or tilts of a greater degree that are obvioulsy intended to increase the esthetics of the photo.', '2008-06-07 19:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756464, 683748, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lighting does a good job focusing the eye on the subject.</td>', 'Lighting does a good job focusing the eye on the subject.', '2008-06-07 19:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756469, 684157, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the focus you''ve chosen here. I like the lone subject, small in the nature you''ve captured. Centered boundary between water and land would generally beconsidered less effective than a less centered boundary, but in this case, it works pretty well.</td>', 'I like the focus you''ve chosen here. I like the lone subject, small in the nature you''ve captured. Centered boundary between water and land would generally beconsidered less effective than a less centered boundary, but in this case, it works pretty well.', '2008-06-07 19:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756471, 681729, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''ve chosen a soft focus for this. Sometimes having something, however small, in perfect focus enhances the overall soft effect. Sepia works well.<br/> <br/>Sometimes we take photos that mean a great deal to us because of our affinity with the subject. Perhaps that''s the case here. But I don''t have an affinity with the subject, so it''s not as interesting to me.</td>', 'You''ve chosen a soft focus for this. Sometimes having something, however small, in perfect focus enhances the overall soft effect. Sepia works well. Sometimes we take photos that mean a great deal to us because of our affinity with the subject. Perhaps that''s the case here. But I don''t have an affinity with the subject, so it''s not as interesting to me.', '2008-06-07 19:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756476, 677725, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am personally weary of "trash the model" photos, but given the genra, this works pretty well.</td>', 'I am personally weary of "trash the model" photos, but given the genra, this works pretty well.', '2008-06-07 19:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756481, 682979, 18197, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 3 on first look. I came back to comment and realized the subject wasn''t a junction box. This is actually a very interesting subject, well captured and presented. Bumping at least 3 points.</td>', 'I gave this a 3 on first look. I came back to comment and realized the subject wasn''t a junction box. This is actually a very interesting subject, well captured and presented. Bumping at least 3 points.', '2008-06-07 19:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756484, 679288, 18197, '<td valign="top">I find the hindmost part of a cat difficult to be interested in. But I like the framing and that you''ve captured one eye looking back. They partially redeem my interest in this.</td>', 'I find the hindmost part of a cat difficult to be interested in. But I like the framing and that you''ve captured one eye looking back. They partially redeem my interest in this.', '2008-06-07 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756498, 677016, 18197, '<td valign="top">Excellant application of high key and selective saturation. But we''ve seen lots of it before and this one adds little beyond the others. Perhaps, if all but the eyes were converted to B&amp;W, it would be more effective?</td>', 'Excellant application of high key and selective saturation. But we''ve seen lots of it before and this one adds little beyond the others. Perhaps, if all but the eyes were converted to B&W, it would be more effective?', '2008-06-07 19:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756501, 684313, 18197, '<td valign="top">Your choice of saturation goes beyond what I find pleasing. I do like how the contrast between blue and red seems to thrust the red forward. And with my bifocals, it gives it a 3D effect.</td>', 'Your choice of saturation goes beyond what I find pleasing. I do like how the contrast between blue and red seems to thrust the red forward. And with my bifocals, it gives it a 3D effect.', '2008-06-07 19:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756540, 681678, 3746, '<td valign="top">if there is any justie this will ribbon.. amazing..</td>', 'if there is any justie this will ribbon.. amazing..', '2008-06-07 19:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
