(4756851, 678727, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cool in how it looks like some kind of ad.  It must be the lighting on the fans that makes this so different from a regular concert shot.  The only thing that is really odd to me is that these fans are so close to the guy with the mic and they do not really seem all that excited about it.  To me it''s like they don''t even know he is there.</td>', 'This is cool in how it looks like some kind of ad.  It must be the lighting on the fans that makes this so different from a regular concert shot.  The only thing that is really odd to me is that these fans are so close to the guy with the mic and they do not really seem all that excited about it.  To me it''s like they don''t even know he is there.', '2008-06-07 23:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
