(4756906, 684097, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cute!  I love how it looks like the duck is smiling.</td>', 'This is cute!  I love how it looks like the duck is smiling.', '2008-06-08 00:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756907, 684218, 59740, '<td valign="top">Cute babies are unfair competition. I love it.</td>', 'Cute babies are unfair competition. I love it.', '2008-06-08 00:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756909, 684303, 67697, '<td valign="top">With your title, it looks like she is almost pulling away from the guy and saying that to you lol.  I do like tho how she is looking at the camera.  I like the lighting on them too.</td>', 'With your title, it looks like she is almost pulling away from the guy and saying that to you lol.  I do like tho how she is looking at the camera.  I like the lighting on them too.', '2008-06-08 00:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756914, 682447, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene.  I like the reflections.  Also cool is the bridge location in your comp.</td>', 'Very pretty scene.  I like the reflections.  Also cool is the bridge location in your comp.', '2008-06-08 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756916, 683298, 67697, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a little more light on their faces so we could actually see the eyes.  I love how you''ve got them lined up like this and the one in the back cracks me up.</td>', 'I wish there was a little more light on their faces so we could actually see the eyes.  I love how you''ve got them lined up like this and the one in the back cracks me up.', '2008-06-08 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756918, 680234, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the fun and enery of this.</td>', 'I like the fun and enery of this.', '2008-06-08 00:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756921, 680094, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on the composition. The colors and contrast are so stark. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice job on the composition. The colors and contrast are so stark. Nice work.', '2008-06-08 00:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756922, 684294, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol well this is very different.  Did you choose to oversharpen to make her stand out from the background?  That kind of works but it added a weird distortion to the numbers and hands on the clock.</td>', 'lol well this is very different.  Did you choose to oversharpen to make her stand out from the background?  That kind of works but it added a weird distortion to the numbers and hands on the clock.', '2008-06-08 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756924, 678666, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like his eyes and the rich greens in the photo.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'I like his eyes and the rich greens in the photo.  Nice portrait.', '2008-06-08 00:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756925, 679478, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the B&amp;W. Unique image.</td>', 'Nice job with the B&W. Unique image.', '2008-06-08 00:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756926, 684230, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the selective desat.  It gives the walkway a little dreamy quality.</td>', 'I like the selective desat.  It gives the walkway a little dreamy quality.', '2008-06-08 00:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756928, 678727, 23484, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. You really captured the feeling well. 9</td>', 'Fantastic shot. You really captured the feeling well. 9', '2008-06-08 00:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756929, 684065, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the range of colors.  I don''t like the grain tho because it kind of breaks up the beautiful magenta colors in the back.</td>', 'I love the range of colors.  I don''t like the grain tho because it kind of breaks up the beautiful magenta colors in the back.', '2008-06-08 00:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756930, 677016, 23484, '<td valign="top">I love the way the eyes stand out. It goes so well with the blown highlights. Great job. 10</td>', 'I love the way the eyes stand out. It goes so well with the blown highlights. Great job. 10', '2008-06-08 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756931, 678318, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice Black &amp; White. I like the contrast.</td>', 'Very nice Black & White. I like the contrast.', '2008-06-08 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756932, 680143, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia tone and the lights.  Beautiful sky too.  I feel like I am waiting for the fog to roll in now :)</td>', 'I like the sepia tone and the lights.  Beautiful sky too.  I feel like I am waiting for the fog to roll in now :)', '2008-06-08 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756933, 683181, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat.</td>', 'Nice selective desat.', '2008-06-08 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756934, 684193, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of the photo.  It adds to the innocent quality of the puppy.  Cute!</td>', 'I like the softness of the photo.  It adds to the innocent quality of the puppy.  Cute!', '2008-06-08 00:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756935, 677252, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The colors are fantastic and go together so well.</td>', 'Beautiful image. The colors are fantastic and go together so well.', '2008-06-08 00:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756936, 683250, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2008-06-08 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756937, 677725, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the makeup and the expression.  But the lighting makes her teeth looks yellow.  With nice teeth like that I think I''d want to see them whiter so they would stand out a little more.</td>', 'I love the makeup and the expression.  But the lighting makes her teeth looks yellow.  With nice teeth like that I think I''d want to see them whiter so they would stand out a little more.', '2008-06-08 00:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756938, 684281, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very cute candid.  What a moment!  Love how happy he looks.</td>', 'Very cute candid.  What a moment!  Love how happy he looks.', '2008-06-08 00:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756940, 678322, 67697, '<td valign="top">That''s cool.  At first glance they look real.  Love the landscape you have captured too.</td>', 'That''s cool.  At first glance they look real.  Love the landscape you have captured too.', '2008-06-08 00:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756941, 679865, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how the splotch of red pops out from all the greens.  Great catch.  I would never have seen something like this.</td>', 'I love how the splotch of red pops out from all the greens.  Great catch.  I would never have seen something like this.', '2008-06-08 00:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756942, 681760, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great closeup and lighting.  I love the water drops on it''s head.</td>', 'Great closeup and lighting.  I love the water drops on it''s head.', '2008-06-08 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756944, 683852, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like the part under the water too.  Great catch of the details on the ice too.  I bet this is beautiful to see in person.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like the part under the water too.  Great catch of the details on the ice too.  I bet this is beautiful to see in person.', '2008-06-08 00:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756946, 683587, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like how the parts out of focus look like a watercolor painting.</td>', 'I like how the parts out of focus look like a watercolor painting.', '2008-06-08 00:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756950, 684247, 67697, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the bird is really cool.  I wish there was a little more in front too to make the body stand out as well.  I love the contrast of the white feathers against the dark background.</td>', 'The lighting on the bird is really cool.  I wish there was a little more in front too to make the body stand out as well.  I love the contrast of the white feathers against the dark background.', '2008-06-08 00:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756953, 684275, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like this for the fun and energy of it.  Her hair looks like a beautiful red flame.</td>', 'I like this for the fun and energy of it.  Her hair looks like a beautiful red flame.', '2008-06-08 00:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756955, 683722, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the brilliant blue.  I also like this sideways perpective of the feathers.</td>', 'I love the brilliant blue.  I also like this sideways perpective of the feathers.', '2008-06-08 00:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756959, 684247, 42495, '<td valign="top">The lighting is stunning.</td>', 'The lighting is stunning.', '2008-06-08 00:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756968, 682377, 67697, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are wicked freaky lol.  If I saw this out in the wild, I would certainly be inclined to run :)  Beautiful capture.</td>', 'Those eyes are wicked freaky lol.  If I saw this out in the wild, I would certainly be inclined to run :)  Beautiful capture.', '2008-06-08 00:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756969, 682979, 67697, '<td valign="top">At first I was not sure what i was looking at.  I thought it was some box with some odd picture in it.  Then I saw the doors.  What a really cool way to mess with someone''s sense of perspective.</td>', 'At first I was not sure what i was looking at.  I thought it was some box with some odd picture in it.  Then I saw the doors.  What a really cool way to mess with someone''s sense of perspective.', '2008-06-08 00:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756971, 675840, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cool and biblical looking.  I cannot wait to come back and read how you did this.</td>', 'This is cool and biblical looking.  I cannot wait to come back and read how you did this.', '2008-06-08 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756972, 683103, 61961, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally go crazy over bird photos, but this is so beautifully done.  I''d hang this in a gallery.  One of my challenge favorites.</td>', 'I don''t normally go crazy over bird photos, but this is so beautifully done.  I''d hang this in a gallery.  One of my challenge favorites.', '2008-06-08 00:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4756974, 683257, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this.  Beautiful balance between the plant and the bug.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this.  Beautiful balance between the plant and the bug.', '2008-06-08 00:50:51.000000', NULL, 1);
