(4757064, 682979, 18197, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dr.Confuser:</b></div><hr/><i> I gave this a 3 on first look. I came back to comment and realized the subject wasn''t a junction box. This is actually a very interesting subject, well captured and presented. Bumping at least 3 points. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Really should have scored higher. I think the thumbnail and/or a quick look at a subtle image sabotaged this. It is an amazing image. Please PM me and let me know where it was taken. Thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by Dr.Confuser: I gave this a 3 on first look. I came back to comment and realized the subject wasn''t a junction box. This is actually a very interesting subject, well captured and presented. Bumping at least 3 points.   Really should have scored higher. I think the thumbnail and/or a quick look at a subtle image sabotaged this. It is an amazing image. Please PM me and let me know where it was taken. Thanks.', '2008-06-08 01:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
