(4757104, 684247, 63244, '<td valign="top">Congrats on ribbon number 1...this is such a stunning shot!!</td>', 'Congrats on ribbon number 1...this is such a stunning shot!!', '2008-06-08 01:49:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757105, 682445, 67697, '<td valign="top">Ahh shoot.  I did not make it in time to comment on this.  Even tho I know this is yours, I will tell you what I would have written.  I loved the single white flower on the dark background.  Really captures and holds your attention.  But I felt that the center should have also been brighter.  It''s like the flower is a tad incomplete with the darkness there.  Or maybe it needs to be sharpened - not sure?  Anywho, the petals are just gorgeous.  Great capture of the details in such a bright area.</td>', 'Ahh shoot.  I did not make it in time to comment on this.  Even tho I know this is yours, I will tell you what I would have written.  I loved the single white flower on the dark background.  Really captures and holds your attention.  But I felt that the center should have also been brighter.  It''s like the flower is a tad incomplete with the darkness there.  Or maybe it needs to be sharpened - not sure?  Anywho, the petals are just gorgeous.  Great capture of the details in such a bright area.', '2008-06-08 01:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757106, 684166, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really expected this to do a lot better than it did.  Your editing is very good here - a nice light touch that supports a well balanced, well lit photograph.</td>', 'I really expected this to do a lot better than it did.  Your editing is very good here - a nice light touch that supports a well balanced, well lit photograph.', '2008-06-08 01:49:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757108, 679202, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this guy is very much a part of his environment - he''s not exactly camoflauged, but fits in so nicely in shape and position.  A good natural shot.</td>', 'I really like the way this guy is very much a part of his environment - he''s not exactly camoflauged, but fits in so nicely in shape and position.  A good natural shot.', '2008-06-08 01:51:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757109, 684291, 30982, '<td valign="top">A beautiful pose for this dog - you''ve captured the essence quite well.  I''ll agree with a couple of the other commenters that the vignetting is just a touch strong on the left.</td>', 'A beautiful pose for this dog - you''ve captured the essence quite well.  I''ll agree with a couple of the other commenters that the vignetting is just a touch strong on the left.', '2008-06-08 01:53:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757112, 678848, 47852, '<td valign="top">Oh, I''m so happy this one took the blue!  It was my favorite of the challenge!  I''d love to hear the story on how you got this shot, and even see the original if you''d be willing to share it.  This is just stunning.  Congrats! :)</td>', 'Oh, I''m so happy this one took the blue!  It was my favorite of the challenge!  I''d love to hear the story on how you got this shot, and even see the original if you''d be willing to share it.  This is just stunning.  Congrats! :)', '2008-06-08 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757113, 682979, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sorry - I meant to come back and comment on this - a captivating and intriguing shot.  I really like that you left it in color (which is an odd thing for me to say) but that bit of orange is a wonderful spark amidst the monochromatic scene.  Very well seen - glad you entered this!</td>', 'Sorry - I meant to come back and comment on this - a captivating and intriguing shot.  I really like that you left it in color (which is an odd thing for me to say) but that bit of orange is a wonderful spark amidst the monochromatic scene.  Very well seen - glad you entered this!', '2008-06-08 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757115, 683847, 25355, '<td valign="top">Very impressive! I''ve never seen a shot of the canyon here with a vertical beam.</td>', 'Very impressive! I''ve never seen a shot of the canyon here with a vertical beam.', '2008-06-08 01:56:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757116, 683556, 25355, '<td valign="top">One place I would love to visit. Terrific capture.</td>', 'One place I would love to visit. Terrific capture.', '2008-06-08 01:56:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757117, 683854, 30982, '<td valign="top">A worthy stalking indeed!  Lovely capture, and yes, great light for this.  Congrats on stepping outside your comfort zone!  :-)</td>', 'A worthy stalking indeed!  Lovely capture, and yes, great light for this.  Congrats on stepping outside your comfort zone!  :-)', '2008-06-08 01:57:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757119, 681567, 30982, '<td valign="top">WAY freakin'' underrated.  And I''m a bit surprised I didn''t recognize this as Karma!  Apologize to her for me.  Wonderfully fun shot, Robert.</td>', 'WAY freakin'' underrated.  And I''m a bit surprised I didn''t recognize this as Karma!  Apologize to her for me.  Wonderfully fun shot, Robert.', '2008-06-08 01:58:24.000000', NULL, 0),
