(4757134, 684275, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the energy of this!  And gotta say this is one that definitely wouldn''t work in B&amp;W.  As for the NI/blur - maybe a touch much - in a way that takes just a bit away from the motion aspect, particularly in her hair.</td>', 'Love the energy of this!  And gotta say this is one that definitely wouldn''t work in B&W.  As for the NI/blur - maybe a touch much - in a way that takes just a bit away from the motion aspect, particularly in her hair.', '2008-06-08 02:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757135, 683861, 47852, '<td valign="top">224th?!  Are the voters crazy?  This is lovely, in fact, one of my 10''s from the challenge!  The small path leading you in, the splashes of color, the freshness and simplicity of the shot are all just perfect.  I could sit in the spot you took this from for hours!  I''m so glad you were able to get out for a while on such a beautiful day, and hopefully this photo can be a reminder of the good days when you''re feeling down.  In fact, I think I''ll put it in my favorites so that it can cheer me up on those gray days. :)</td>', '224th?!  Are the voters crazy?  This is lovely, in fact, one of my 10''s from the challenge!  The small path leading you in, the splashes of color, the freshness and simplicity of the shot are all just perfect.  I could sit in the spot you took this from for hours!  I''m so glad you were able to get out for a while on such a beautiful day, and hopefully this photo can be a reminder of the good days when you''re feeling down.  In fact, I think I''ll put it in my favorites so that it can cheer me up on those gray days. :)', '2008-06-08 02:10:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757136, 684247, 66384, '<td valign="top">How wonderful. This is truly exquisite. And what a huge accomplishment to get a ribbon in a free study. Big congratulations!!</td>', 'How wonderful. This is truly exquisite. And what a huge accomplishment to get a ribbon in a free study. Big congratulations!!', '2008-06-08 02:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757137, 677827, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is the way most people get to see this place - a nice cool gray day, rather than the shiny pretty blue in which it is often photographed.  If I were to find a nit with the shot it would be the orange post in the foreground - it''s just a tad strong in the composition perhaps.  Not sure if this would work in B&amp;W but it might be worth a try.</td>', 'This is the way most people get to see this place - a nice cool gray day, rather than the shiny pretty blue in which it is often photographed.  If I were to find a nit with the shot it would be the orange post in the foreground - it''s just a tad strong in the composition perhaps.  Not sure if this would work in B&W but it might be worth a try.', '2008-06-08 02:12:47.000000', NULL, 0),
