(4757185, 680872, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the very well deserved Posthumous blue.  A very powerful image indeed.  I visited this one more than once when in voting.  At first it struck me as kind of sad, but your title creates a stronger, more positive connection here.  It represents (to me, anyway) the bonds that form between people; the bonds that keep us moving on despite obstacles.  And I think the composition is just fine.  It''s a small but brilliant moment caught amongst the realities.  You have a great eye and I for one very much you sharing that with us here.  Please continue to do so.</td>', 'Congrats on the very well deserved Posthumous blue.  A very powerful image indeed.  I visited this one more than once when in voting.  At first it struck me as kind of sad, but your title creates a stronger, more positive connection here.  It represents (to me, anyway) the bonds that form between people; the bonds that keep us moving on despite obstacles.  And I think the composition is just fine.  It''s a small but brilliant moment caught amongst the realities.  You have a great eye and I for one very much you sharing that with us here.  Please continue to do so.', '2008-06-08 02:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757188, 683979, 44877, '<td valign="top">What an excellent catch. The look, the pose, the angle - all fantastic.</td>', 'What an excellent catch. The look, the pose, the angle - all fantastic.', '2008-06-08 02:45:49.000000', NULL, 0),
