(4757249, 684256, 67258, '<td valign="top">Surprised this didn''t score higher - I love the quirky almost surreal nature of the image, and the light is lovely.  If there is one thing I would change, it would be to remove the two pieces of wood standing to the left of the composition.  It may not have resonated with the voters, but I think this is a photograph you should be proud of.</td>', 'Surprised this didn''t score higher - I love the quirky almost surreal nature of the image, and the light is lovely.  If there is one thing I would change, it would be to remove the two pieces of wood standing to the left of the composition.  It may not have resonated with the voters, but I think this is a photograph you should be proud of.', '2008-06-08 03:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
