(4757327, 681761, 34938, '<td valign="top">My uncle had a Zepher! 1964 model in Melbourne. He rushed me to hospital in it while I had an asthma attack. I was 4 and I remember lying on the back seat struggling to breathe while my Grandma prayed and cried...I made it to hospital, but they saud, 10 more minutes and I would not be typing this on dpc! Great image Gerry, congrats on a great result in a FS</td>', 'My uncle had a Zepher! 1964 model in Melbourne. He rushed me to hospital in it while I had an asthma attack. I was 4 and I remember lying on the back seat struggling to breathe while my Grandma prayed and cried...I made it to hospital, but they saud, 10 more minutes and I would not be typing this on dpc! Great image Gerry, congrats on a great result in a FS', '2008-06-08 04:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
