(4757361, 683749, 90495, '<td valign="top">The first commenter touched upon the reason it didn''t score higher. People thought it was a failed attempt at selective desat and scored it appropriately. That''s the first thing that hit me as well. Of course I know it wasn''t desaturated but that''s the look this image has, unfortunately. The shadow at bottom left didn''t help either.</td>', 'The first commenter touched upon the reason it didn''t score higher. People thought it was a failed attempt at selective desat and scored it appropriately. That''s the first thing that hit me as well. Of course I know it wasn''t desaturated but that''s the look this image has, unfortunately. The shadow at bottom left didn''t help either.', '2008-06-08 05:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757368, 676992, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great portrait aguapreta ...  Really like the way her face comes out to us from the dark background and her sidelong glance. There''s fire and intelligence in her eyes...</td>', 'Great portrait aguapreta ...  Really like the way her face comes out to us from the dark background and her sidelong glance. There''s fire and intelligence in her eyes...', '2008-06-08 05:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
