(4757468, 683979, 68586, '<td valign="top">Lesley - great shot and finish.<br/> <br/>I love the tension and dynamics generated through your choice of title.<br/> <br/>The title generates in your mind a happy, cheery, colourful kids tv programme where the world is a bright happy place and problems are always wrapped up easily and everyones warm well fed and happy - Whilst the picture helps remind us of the harsh reality that not all children live in the tv fantasy land, and for many life isn''t a whirl of joy and laughter. For many life is actually pretty grim, and full of hardship.<br/> <br/>simple but powerful shot - perfect title.</td>', 'Lesley - great shot and finish. I love the tension and dynamics generated through your choice of title. The title generates in your mind a happy, cheery, colourful kids tv programme where the world is a bright happy place and problems are always wrapped up easily and everyones warm well fed and happy - Whilst the picture helps remind us of the harsh reality that not all children live in the tv fantasy land, and for many life isn''t a whirl of joy and laughter. For many life is actually pretty grim, and full of hardship. simple but powerful shot - perfect title.', '2008-06-08 08:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
