(4757873, 684164, 55892, '<td valign="top">I really like the creativity;  the focal point, the lighting, the color contrast.  It really deserved a higher score.</td>', 'I really like the creativity;  the focal point, the lighting, the color contrast.  It really deserved a higher score.', '2008-06-08 14:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757874, 675840, 30861, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable how low this scored :-(</td>', 'Unbelievable how low this scored :-(', '2008-06-08 14:05:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4757875, 676992, 67697, '<td valign="top">The noise on her face gave me the impression of too much texture where it did not belong. And then her eyes were smooth and clear so something seemed a bit odd to me with the combo of the two. This probably is something that could not be avoided.  But beyond that, her eyes really pull you into the photo.  They are haunting but border on the edge of slight mishchief too.  A very interesting capture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-09 10:28:33.</i></td>', 'The noise on her face gave me the impression of too much texture where it did not belong. And then her eyes were smooth and clear so something seemed a bit odd to me with the combo of the two. This probably is something that could not be avoided.  But beyond that, her eyes really pull you into the photo.  They are haunting but border on the edge of slight mishchief too.  A very interesting capture.', '2008-06-08 14:06:24.000000', '2008-06-09 11:28:33.000000', 0),
(4757877, 684017, 55892, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites, I thought it would get a higher score.  Boy, the monthly challenge is a tough one!</td>', 'This was one of my favorites, I thought it would get a higher score.  Boy, the monthly challenge is a tough one!', '2008-06-08 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 0),
