(4757888, 682301, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well look at you.  I gave this a 7 (really, take that as a compliment lol).  I''m not a bug fan either.  I thought the clarity of the photo was amazing but I really loved the red glittery wings.  Beautiful catch and a great placement in the FS!  Congrats on your new 2nd PB!!</td>', 'Well look at you.  I gave this a 7 (really, take that as a compliment lol).  I''m not a bug fan either.  I thought the clarity of the photo was amazing but I really loved the red glittery wings.  Beautiful catch and a great placement in the FS!  Congrats on your new 2nd PB!!', '2008-06-08 14:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
