(4758360, 676299, 77188, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> lighting is too harsh, image too small (602 instead of 720 pixels)...quite oversharpened...sorry :( </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, as mentioned in the image information, I haven''t done any sharpening (or indeed any other image manipulation apart from resizing), and the only light source I had was whatever light the display case in the B.U.G.S. house at London Zoo provided.  As for the image size, I cannot recall why I picked that size...<br/> <br/>Still, this is my first entry ever, and I''m someone even bothered to comment on my picture at all.<br/> <br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: lighting is too harsh, image too small (602 instead of 720 pixels)...quite oversharpened...sorry :(   Well, as mentioned in the image information, I haven''t done any sharpening (or indeed any other image manipulation apart from resizing), and the only light source I had was whatever light the display case in the B.U.G.S. house at London Zoo provided.  As for the image size, I cannot recall why I picked that size... Still, this is my first entry ever, and I''m someone even bothered to comment on my picture at all. Thanks!', '2008-06-08 20:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
