(4759312, 678848, 78455, '<td valign="top">My initial thoughts were right! Congratulations on your blue - much deserved. I just wish you weren''t as good as you are, because it sure as hell makes me depressed knowing what you can do in pp, and knowing how inadequate I am at it too!!! lol.<br/> <br/>I''m going to start a petition, to get you to reveal your secrets and give us a tutorial. All in favour say ''I''. Lol.</td>', 'My initial thoughts were right! Congratulations on your blue - much deserved. I just wish you weren''t as good as you are, because it sure as hell makes me depressed knowing what you can do in pp, and knowing how inadequate I am at it too!!! lol. I''m going to start a petition, to get you to reveal your secrets and give us a tutorial. All in favour say ''I''. Lol.', '2008-06-09 10:55:39.000000', NULL, 0),
