(4759705, 681204, 61062, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. I think the colors are awesome as well as the vantage point. I think this would of been perfect for the cowboy challenge. Course I dont know many cowboys with swords, but still. Keep up the good work</td>', 'Very nice capture. I think the colors are awesome as well as the vantage point. I think this would of been perfect for the cowboy challenge. Course I dont know many cowboys with swords, but still. Keep up the good work', '2008-06-09 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4759765, 678848, 65858, '<td valign="top">Unreal!  Fantastic editing, Richard!  Congrats!<br/> <br/>Makes me want to go back and reedit some moose shots I took last fall...</td>', 'Unreal!  Fantastic editing, Richard!  Congrats! Makes me want to go back and reedit some moose shots I took last fall...', '2008-06-09 15:32:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4759779, 682068, 36999, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard of it, but not actually seen it!  I see bulls get trimmed all the time.  I had no idea they would constrain the leg...  much more amiable in that regard than a horse!  Great image!  Nice PP.</td>', 'I''ve heard of it, but not actually seen it!  I see bulls get trimmed all the time.  I had no idea they would constrain the leg...  much more amiable in that regard than a horse!  Great image!  Nice PP.', '2008-06-09 15:44:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4759875, 677178, 68586, '<td valign="top">Well spotted - and great use of DoF.<br/> <br/>ps nice colours as well</td>', 'Well spotted - and great use of DoF. ps nice colours as well', '2008-06-09 16:50:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4759879, 680158, 68586, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a moment to capture - and what a stunning place.<br/> <br/>Surprised this didn''t come higher</td>', 'Wow - what a moment to capture - and what a stunning place. Surprised this didn''t come higher', '2008-06-09 16:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4759885, 684097, 68586, '<td valign="top">Christiane - I''ve already said how lovely this shot is - and nothings changed  :- )<br/> <br/>Sadly it lost out to the ''point &amp; Click voters'' who don''t take the time to really look at a picture and appreciate it.<br/> <br/>This could be a great ''stock shot'' for a Mallard.</td>', 'Christiane - I''ve already said how lovely this shot is - and nothings changed  :- ) Sadly it lost out to the ''point & Click voters'' who don''t take the time to really look at a picture and appreciate it. This could be a great ''stock shot'' for a Mallard.', '2008-06-09 16:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
