(4768565, 678056, 811, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUE<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>First off, I love the tight composition of this.  While the tower thingy in the background is a bit distracting, in one sense (and it would make a really cool picture without at), in another sense, it adds to the shot by contrasting old/traditional with more modern.<br/> <br/>Technically, the focus, exposure, etc. is good.  I think the biggest thing noticeable to me is that it seems to be gray overall.  It needs some more distinct white/light areas, I think.  Admittedly, I am not sure how or where, unless in the conversion process you could get the whitish area on the right a bit brighter.<br/> <br/>Overall, a nice shot.  It is very graphic and clean.<br/> <br/>Best to you in future challenges.<br/>Karama</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUEby karmat First off, I love the tight composition of this.  While the tower thingy in the background is a bit distracting, in one sense (and it would make a really cool picture without at), in another sense, it adds to the shot by contrasting old/traditional with more modern. Technically, the focus, exposure, etc. is good.  I think the biggest thing noticeable to me is that it seems to be gray overall.  It needs some more distinct white/light areas, I think.  Admittedly, I am not sure how or where, unless in the conversion process you could get the whitish area on the right a bit brighter. Overall, a nice shot.  It is very graphic and clean. Best to you in future challenges.Karama', '2008-06-14 12:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4768644, 683774, 90947, '<td valign="top">I love his photo.  It reminds me of an old Dutch Master painting.  If I were to suggest anything, I might be to bump up the contrast a bit to give more detail to the clouds in the sky.  All in all, this is, in my not so humble opinion, a great shot and believe the 8s and 9s got it right.</td>', 'I love his photo.  It reminds me of an old Dutch Master painting.  If I were to suggest anything, I might be to bump up the contrast a bit to give more detail to the clouds in the sky.  All in all, this is, in my not so humble opinion, a great shot and believe the 8s and 9s got it right.', '2008-06-14 13:54:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4768909, 678362, 17203, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait, Judi. I''m shocked that this didn''t score higher. My only criticism is that it looks better to me cropped just below the light area at her hairline (just scroll your entry up to see what I mean).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-14 20:12:21.</i></td>', 'Awesome portrait, Judi. I''m shocked that this didn''t score higher. My only criticism is that it looks better to me cropped just below the light area at her hairline (just scroll your entry up to see what I mean).', '2008-06-14 21:11:07.000000', '2008-06-14 21:12:21.000000', 0),
