(4769421, 684337, 68586, '<td valign="top">Great idea - wonderful backdrop.<br/> <br/>Love the title, sets up the idea of the picture perfectly and lends weight to the rich golden colour in the background.<br/> <br/>I wonder whether it could have been cropped a little tighter on the right though - say to the edge of the circle behind his head/neck ? There just doesn''t seem to be a lot happening in that last inch.<br/> <br/>A great shot though - should have done better.</td>', 'Great idea - wonderful backdrop. Love the title, sets up the idea of the picture perfectly and lends weight to the rich golden colour in the background. I wonder whether it could have been cropped a little tighter on the right though - say to the edge of the circle behind his head/neck ? There just doesn''t seem to be a lot happening in that last inch. A great shot though - should have done better.', '2008-06-15 09:07:15.000000', NULL, 0),
