(4770250, 680030, 49804, '<td valign="top">To be honest the first thing I notice is the lighting, it''s lacking a punch that would add a lot. Another thing I noticed is that my eye doesn''t know where to go, is the main subject the thing he is making or is it him? One thing that would be cool on this would be to have a shallower DOF, so that only the guy is in focus, to add more emphasis to him being the main subject. Another thing would be to come from a different angle, so that you can see more of the shaper. I like the environmental portrait that it is, as noted by Erica.</td>', 'To be honest the first thing I notice is the lighting, it''s lacking a punch that would add a lot. Another thing I noticed is that my eye doesn''t know where to go, is the main subject the thing he is making or is it him? One thing that would be cool on this would be to have a shallower DOF, so that only the guy is in focus, to add more emphasis to him being the main subject. Another thing would be to come from a different angle, so that you can see more of the shaper. I like the environmental portrait that it is, as noted by Erica.', '2008-06-15 23:03:41.000000', NULL, 0),
