(4789150, 681729, 61961, '<td valign="top">What a sweet boy little, I love the composition.  You''ll find that DPC voters tend to feel that sharpness is paramount.  Photos lose clarity when resizing, so you may need to experiment with resize techniques &amp; parameters (e.g., bicubic, bilinear, etc.).  Check out the DPC tutorials on saving for the web, too.<br/> <br/>Cheers, and welcome to DPC!</td>', 'What a sweet boy little, I love the composition.  You''ll find that DPC voters tend to feel that sharpness is paramount.  Photos lose clarity when resizing, so you may need to experiment with resize techniques & parameters (e.g., bicubic, bilinear, etc.).  Check out the DPC tutorials on saving for the web, too. Cheers, and welcome to DPC!', '2008-06-28 14:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
