(4905915, 683934, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very underappreciated.  What I liked about this (and I do remember it from voting) is the warmth of her smile, the great use of natural light (or at least it seems to be natural light) and the fact there''s texture to the background which gives it depth.  Very good use of DOF, too!</td>', 'Very underappreciated.  What I liked about this (and I do remember it from voting) is the warmth of her smile, the great use of natural light (or at least it seems to be natural light) and the fact there''s texture to the background which gives it depth.  Very good use of DOF, too!', '2008-08-23 10:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
