(5126865, 682657, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is just freaking awesome. I wish you could see more of here because she draws in your attention but still an awesome shot.</td>', 'This is just freaking awesome. I wish you could see more of here because she draws in your attention but still an awesome shot.', '2008-12-12 11:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5128456, 683971, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like how there seem to be two different stories going on here - the two people with the dark horse in the background, and the little girl with the pale horse in the front. My only complaint is that compositionally speaking this is a little busy... perhaps some shallow DOF might have helped separate them? But in any case, the expression on the little girl''s face is priceless. Something also, about how the face of the horse is cropped off makes him seem more threatening, so the viewer understands the girl''s apprehension.</td>', 'I like how there seem to be two different stories going on here - the two people with the dark horse in the background, and the little girl with the pale horse in the front. My only complaint is that compositionally speaking this is a little busy... perhaps some shallow DOF might have helped separate them? But in any case, the expression on the little girl''s face is priceless. Something also, about how the face of the horse is cropped off makes him seem more threatening, so the viewer understands the girl''s apprehension.', '2008-12-13 09:02:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5137358, 682657, 20577, '<td valign="top">Should have done much better.</td>', 'Should have done much better.', '2008-12-17 13:39:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5140177, 680143, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous photograph.  Excellent choice of perspective and framing, great exposure and a nicely cooperative sky, and I really like your choice of toning (duo or tritone?).  Very nicely done.</td>', 'What a gorgeous photograph.  Excellent choice of perspective and framing, great exposure and a nicely cooperative sky, and I really like your choice of toning (duo or tritone?).  Very nicely done.', '2008-12-19 02:23:30.000000', NULL, 0),
